<%- include('../partials/header') %>
<section class="page-hero"><p class="eyebrow">OUR STORY</p><h1>Cricket brings us together.</h1><p class="lead">Sindhi Premier League is a community-driven cricket platform based in Ulhasnagar.</p></section>
<section class="section"><h2>One community. One passion.</h2><p class="body-copy">SPL celebrates cricketing talent, teamwork and the Sindhi community. The league gives players a stage to compete, supporters a reason to come together and partners an opportunity to contribute to local sport.</p><div class="feature-grid"><article class="feature-card"><span>01</span><h3>Competition</h3><p>Organised matches and a platform for emerging and experienced players.</p></article><article class="feature-card"><span>02</span><h3>Community</h3><p>Bringing families, fans, teams and supporters together.</p></article><article class="feature-card"><span>03</span><h3>Sportsmanship</h3><p>Respect, fair play and the spirit of cricket at the heart of the league.</p></article></div></section>
<section class="section dark-panel"><div class="section-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">THE ARCHIVE</p><h2>Every season has a story.</h2></div></div><div class="card-grid"><% if(season_history.length){season_history.forEach(season=>{ %><article class="feature-card"><span>SEASON <%= season.season %></span><h3><%= season.name %></h3><p><%= season.start_date?date(season.start_date):'Dates not recorded' %><%= season.end_date?' – '+date(season.end_date):'' %></p><p><%= season.teams_count %> teams · <%= season.matches_count %> matches</p><p><strong>Champion: <%= season.champion||'Winner not recorded' %></strong></p><a class="text-link" href="/matches/?season=<%= season.season %>">Explore season →</a></article><% })}else{ %><p>Season history will appear here as scorecard archives are added.</p><% } %></div></section>
<%- include('../partials/footer') %>
